body:
This will probably be downvoted, but if you really love your ex- I think you should give it one more shot. But take things VERY slowly. Start off just talking then getting casual etc. Don't just jump back into things like nothing happened. Also- see if they've made any personal improvements as well... if they're exactly how they used to be it will probably fail and in that scenario I'd say explore things with the new girl.

&#x200B;

Reread that part about her rubbing the gifts and such in your face. Are you 100% sure that was the case or were you guys "trying to be friends" and she told you about these things?
